      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:20:13",
      "sequence": 31048,
      "chapter_label": "REV 20",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "The sea gave up the dead who were in it. Death and Hades gave up the dead who were in them. They were judged, each one according to his works.",
      "ko": "바다가 그 가운데서 죽은 자들을 내어주고 또 사망과 음부도 그 가운데서 죽은 자들을 내어주매 각 사람이 자기의 행위대로 심판을 받고",
      "source_text_hash": "8bb1d65bb45fa8d588c2e6709bffb0eb89204ab3491e721467c9a3de9b027981",
      "translation_text_hash": "175f723988064ede714eee13760f84dcc5e7535a855ad151cab82fdb842c24d5",
